# Q24 / B-2: the checksum manifest is a trust record. Its committed blob is LF
# and its blob identity is pinned as a constant in scripts/certification_support.py;
# a CRLF checkout would change the file bytes without changing a digest it records.
CHECKSUMS.sha256 -text

# The reference binary is the D-001 numerical authority. Never line-ending mangled.
swetest binary
